WEBVTT

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:05.770
Lala!

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.520
Did Tricolore make it-pri?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.250
Yep! Their show was amazing!

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.200
That's great-kuma!

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.330
I'd have loved to see their formation ceremony.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.880
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.170
Breaking PriPara news.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:29.230
I've just been informed that one more team will be entering the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:35.170
Hibiki-san, Falulu-san and Fuwari-san's team:

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:36.530
Tricolore!

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.220
Oh, yeah, Tricolore!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:39.930
That's so great!

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.040
They're really cutting it fine-pri...

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.980
Good for you, Falulu.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.770
I'm so glad!

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:46.440
Indeed.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.940
Yep!

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.960
But they'll surely be formidable foes.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:50.880
Garu.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.400
Tricolore, j'adore!

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:01.260
Capisce!

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.950
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:05.080
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:09.280
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.850
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:13.880
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:55.860
A hallway?

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:59.960
The atrium stage is at the end of this hallway-tori.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:04.060
We have to hurry there so we can enter-tori!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:04.870
Yeah!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.700
Why are you dragging your heels-tori?

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.230
We've come all this way – what's the point in rushing now?

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:27.050
We have simply to make

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.640
our splendid and most elegant entrance.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.220
Tricolore shall triumph.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.110
This fact is preordained.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:37.610
You can't say that-tori!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.650
TORI
You can't say that-tori!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:38.820
TORI

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.470
The future is a closed book, you know!

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:42.990
You never know what could happen...

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:46.250
Pure amore love...

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:46.660
Tori!

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.580
... like this.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.120
Pure amore love–

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.200
... like this.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.380
Pure amore – tori?!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.090
Even this could be... <i>fall</i> you-tori!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.120
TORI
Even this could be... <i>fall</i> you-tori!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.010
TORI

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.850
Toriko-san!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.560
Hibiki-sama...

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:14.380
It's SoLaMi SMILE's team coord! And it seems the three members decided on a new colour arrangement!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.380
SoLaMi SMILE Coord!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:17.730
Pri!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.680
Making Drama, switch on!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.630
Look upon it!

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:30.460
Pri!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:33.280
Let it bloom!

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.200
And the winds of romance blow!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.600
Dance of the Butterfly!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.960
Super Cyalume Change!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:03.300
Pri!

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.240
It's gotta be SoLaMi SMILE!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:35.380
SoLaMi SMILE's number one!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.200
The audience is feverish!

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:39.840
What a tremendous performance-ucha.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.100
Don't act so amazed.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.170
When I unleash my full potential, I can easily top that!

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:46.930
But in order to do that...

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.530
I must form a team as soon as possible!

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:52.920
Hmph!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.280
Kuma!

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.420
Beary well done, girls!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.200
Isn't that right, Jululu-cha...

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.640
It's a shoebill!

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:08.480
<i>Pri!</i>

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.490
President Minami...

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.140
Were you aware?

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.540
With seahorses...

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.540
the male births and raises the child!

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.680
And that's why...

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.760
<i>We'll take the "a" from "Amamiya" and the "Mi" from "Mirei...</i>

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.640
<i>and call you Ami!</i>

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.410
<i>Daddy!</i>

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.100
I have conceived a little brother for Ami-chan!

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:35.080
With the "ma" from "Amamiya" and the "re" from "Mirei...

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.970
And call him Rema!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.310
Hey there, Rema!

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:45.180
When you grow up, I won't let you get married if it's not a wonderful woman like your mother!

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:53.020
Pri! Pri!

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.260
Mirei-san...
Pri! Pri!

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:54.620
Pri! Pri!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.980
That was really good!

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:16.970
A spectacular performance –
and it is our duty as rivals to eclipse it.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:21.620
You just wait! We'll knock you out of this atrium and the whole galaxy!

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.460
Hurry, Maho-chan!

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.020
We really might not make it at this rate!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.140
The audience will be able to admire our performance in the flesh.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:36.720
Considering the extravagance we're to bestow, we can make them wait a little.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:37.760
Maho-chan...

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.450
You're so lackadaisical...

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:45.020
Why is it that being with Hibiki-san causes me no end of worries?

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.120
Honestly!

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:56.980
It's Dressing Pafé's team coord. The tail and pompom charms, chosen by the members, command attention!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.720
Crosswalk Coord!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:08:59.640
<i>Go</i>!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.240
Yay!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:57.200
Making Drama, switch on!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.230
Gajira!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.180
Transform:

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.200
PriPara Go Change!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.200
Idol Soldiers:

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.210
PriPara Girls!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.580
Lock on!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.460
Super Cyalume Change!

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:27.470
<i>Go</i>!

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:28.190
Yay!

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:53.840
DrePa, you're so wonderful!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.690
DrePa, you're number one!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:00.260
The audience is alive! Dressing Pafé has really captured their hearts!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.580
They really have...

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:05.430
Come on, they went way wilder for SoLaMi SMILE-pri.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.310
That was so amazing!

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:16.380
I feel our performance is all but forgotten... as though it were a week in the past...

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.060
Geru?

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:21.340
Drawing the first spot may have worked against us-nekon.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:26.000
That's not true! Garuru and everyone else, we all gave it our best!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.730
That'ch exactly right!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.090
Indeed!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:30.450
Gerun!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.570
In round three of the Divine Idol Grand Prix...

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.930
our concluding team is of course...

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.230
Scan the appropriate number of tickets for your coord.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.020
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.460
Starting the Coord Change.

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:12.000
The first team coord of the rapidly-rising popular Tricolore:

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.220
the refined red, white and blue colour scheme is its key point!

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.100
Flower of PriParis Coord!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.730
What should I do, Hibiki-sama?

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.620
Go for gold, Falulu!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.590
Bring it on, Fuwari-chan!

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:30.060
Say... they're not coming out.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.520
You're not saying they didn't make it in time after all-pri?

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.310
I wouldn't rule it out!

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:36.610
Usa?

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.400
Seek ye in still melancholy some comfort?

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.180
Huh?

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.790
Here be kin: let my voice resound and be salvation!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.050
You're here at last, Hibiki-sama!

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:03.050
My world is ever-expanding!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.180
As long as I sing, and as long as I dance!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.430
Falulu, you're gorgeous!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.970
For we reach gently and softly into your hearts,

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.050
like a fresh spring breeze!

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:16.750
I can't get enough of you, Fuwari!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.140
Look well.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.340
Behold the performance of Tricolore,

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:23.100
who shall receive the goddess's blessing!

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:27.540
I love you, Hibiki-sama!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:11.090
Making Drama, switch on!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.660
Whoa, whoa.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:19.940
Layhee!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.820
We want to win!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.240
We've gotta win!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.620
We will stand above all!

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:35.370
For you! A mysterious spring pristine rhapsody!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:38.510
Super Cyalume Change!

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:09.070
I'm so glad I came to PriPara!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.850
Hibiki-sama, Hibiki-sama, Hibiki-sama!

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:13.630
What an amazing response!

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:18.440
That celebrity aura is incredible!

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:23.150
The excited cows and goats are beating at the doors!

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:27.400
<i>And likes from all viewers over the world are flooding in!</i>

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.560
I'm so happy-tori!

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:34.970
They powered up their Making Drama as well-tori...

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:38.130
I can die happy! I can be turned into yakitori happy-tori!

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.620
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:42.090
There isn't a grill in sight!

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.940
You've done well, both of you.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.440
Now... you, goat.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:52.060
You're being officially appointed to Tricolore'ch assistant manager.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:52.530
Naa?

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:56.240
Here are your business cards: the mark of a manager.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:00.340
Your name shall be Goat Naa-naa Moo-moo Banana Bread Dough.

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:03.010
Thank you graciously.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:09.520
The excitement isn't dying down at all.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:12.340
Such unrivalled perfection!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.450
I couldn't imagine they'd excel so...

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:19.320
Man, I'd have swapped their PriTickets for rocks if I'd known it'd turn out like this.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.210
Announcing the winner!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.500
Here we go!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.110
Come, Divine Closet!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:34.280
Show me your greatest performance!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:39.240
Divine Idol Grand Prix, switch on!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.210
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:53.930
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.160
I bestow upon you a coord fit for a Divine Idol...

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.450
The Divine Shoes!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.920
Take it, o worthy idol.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.660
Open, Divine Closet!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.010
We did it!

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:47.970
Would you believe it?

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:52.300
After entering at the last moment, Tricolore has won

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:53.690
with an overwhelming performance!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.180
Thank you, everyone!

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:03.140
Well, the match demonstrated our difference in ability quite thoroughly.

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:07.770
I was hoping for a bit more excitement in the matter.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:12.170
And we have <i>quite</i> the exciting surprise for Hibiki-san!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:16.550
A very special guest has come a long way to congratulate you!

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.220
Is it my co-star DiCappuccino?

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.580
Or perhaps the queen of the Paltic states?

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:25.260
Little Curly!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:29.770
You were terrific! Terracotta warrior-ific!

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.610
Stay away!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:35.490
Little Curly!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:40.150
Wai-Titian! Wai-Titian! I have to congra-Tomioka Izusa you!

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:43.550
Isn't it great Maho-chan found some excitement?

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:48.360
Those two do get along well, don't they?

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:50.800
Almost as well as the three of us do!

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:55.290
I guess Pricolore can have this one-pri.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.090
It's "Tricolore"...

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.330
And we three shall aim for still greater heights!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.860
Let's all do our best together!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:03.590
Tch.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:07.480
This devil shall become a deity and unite this world!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.650
We're gonna be Divine Idols!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:10.850
Garu!

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:17.110
I'm already super psyched for the next Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.160
We have an announcement:

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:22.200
the next Divine Idol Grand Prix will be the last,

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.780
and the final piece of the Divine Coord will be freed!

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:26.780
What?

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:30.250
When all four pieces of the Divine Coord are freed,

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:33.970
an unimaginable wonder will occur!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:37.460
To receive the honour of freeing the last piece of the Divine Coord,

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.960
go for it, everyone!

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:40.420
Okay!

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:41.760
Capisce!

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.690
Lady Falulu! Fuwari-san!

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:50.570
You were truly amazing!

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:51.530
Ucha!

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:52.770
Thank you!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:53.980
Hibiki-sama.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:54.390
Cha?

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.610
Disband Tricolore forthwith,

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.070
and form a new team with me!

00:20:59.300 --> 00:20:59.940
Huh?

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:03.900
Like heck she's gonna do that!

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:06.770
This is no place for commoners to wag their tongues.

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:07.920
What'd you say?

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:11.370
Okay, then how many okonomiyaki spatulas you got in your place?

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.460
We've got a whole hundred! Guess we win and you lose!

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.850
We're the <i>real</i> celebrities around here!

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.270
Prostrate and capisce!

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.420
Capisce!

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:20.850
So...

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:23.390
I'm flattered.

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:28.640
But it seems our meeting was too late. A pity.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.760
How could an invitation from my exalted and elegant self be rejected?

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:33.820
On top of Chiri, I'm sure we'll have many powerful rivals for the last Grand Prix...
How could an invitation from my exalted and elegant self be rejected?

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:36.810
On top of Chiri, I'm sure we'll have many powerful rivals for the last Grand Prix...

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.980
Next time, we're going on stage-chanko!

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.940
Leonardo da Victory!

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.440
Cosmic!

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:49.600
If we don't win this time, the path to Divine Idolhood will be snipped off!

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:51.650
And if that happened...

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.820
Don't worry about that-usa! I just know Jewlie will acknowledge your efforts, Usacha!

00:21:56.820 --> 00:21:57.290
Usa?

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:00.040
Nii-cha, you're my rival-ucha!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.340
Touch me and you'll get cut-ucha!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.880
In this contest, we

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.220
Should encourage each other

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.800
Do you detest me?

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.170
A haiku.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.510
What's going to happen with Non and Chiri-chan?

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:16.410
I hope they can enter the last Grand Prix...

00:23:51.520 --> 00:23:53.870
There's only one Divine Idol Grand Prix left!

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:56.260
I've gotta form a team and claim my victory!

00:23:56.260 --> 00:23:58.110
Prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:23:58.110 --> 00:23:58.940
Chiri?!

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:01.310
The winner of the next Grand Prix shall be I.

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:02.780
Now stand aside.

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:05.450
Don't think you'll have it that easy! Right, Usacha?

00:24:05.450 --> 00:24:06.880
Huh? Usacha?

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:08.850
Non, have you seen Kuma-san around?

00:24:08.850 --> 00:24:11.970
PriPara managers are disappearing left and right!

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:12.880
What?

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:16.940
Next time, <i>The Managers Have Vanished! The Mysterious Sapanna Girl</i>

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
